            <Link href="/admin" style={{ color: "#c3c9d6", fontSize: "13px", textDecoration: "none" }}>â† Admin paneli</Link>
          </div>
          <h1 style={{ fontSize: "clamp(30px,4vw,45px)", letterSpacing: "-.05em", margin: "20px 0 10px" }}>OpenF1 Telsiz ArÅŸivi</h1>
          <p style={{ color: "#a7afbd", lineHeight: 1.65, margin: "0 0 28px" }}>
            GerÃ§ek telsizleri OpenF1 arÅŸivinden yÄ±l, yarÄ±ÅŸ, seans ve pilota gÃ¶re ara. Ã–nizle, seÃ§ ve arÅŸivine ekle.
            Ana sayfanÄ±n saÄŸ altÄ±ndaki TEAM RADIO penceresinde yalnÄ±zca yayÄ±mladÄ±ÄŸÄ±n kayÄ±tlar gÃ¶rÃ¼nÃ¼r.
